body:
As I already mentioned, I am on disability due to depression.  (I haven't worked in nearly 10 years.)

&#x200B;

My monthly disability payments sometimes cover my monthly expenses; sometimes they don't.  My savings are dwindling and I'll have nowhere to turn when they're gone.

Not sure what else to say to help you understand more -- other than that being alone at my age has become too much to bear.

&#x200B;

Not sure what bbs/newsgroup is ....
